---
title: "Life OS: the Calendar view reading Google"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: settled
    lg1: reading
    lg2: waiting
    lg3: stuck
    lg4: Breaks ACoveredWindowWasFetched
    lg5: Path to the ACoveredWindowWasFetched bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 breaks
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: This week was never fetched
  s1: Reading Google
  s2: Fetch failed, blocked for five minutes
  s3: This week is fetched
  s4: Waiting out the navigation gap
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the view asks Google [the gate is open]
  s1 --> s2: the first read fails
  s1 --> s3: Google answers or the refresh fails, the week keeps its old events
  s2 --> s4: you open another week
  s3 --> s4: you open another week
  s2 --> s0: you open another week
  s2 --> s1: the view asks Google [the gate is open]
  s3 --> s0: you open another week
  s3 --> s1: the view asks Google [the gate is open]
  s4 --> s0: time passes
  s4 --> s1: the view asks Google [the gate is open]
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 orange
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s4 blue
